msgid ""
"**Description**: Get Gene Ontology (GO) functional annotations from a "
"MGnify metagenomics analysis. Returns GO terms with their accession, "
"description, gene count, and category (biological\\_process, "
"molecular\\_function, or cellular\\_component). Use to understand the "
"functional capacity of a microbial community. Example: MGYA00585482 "
"returns GO:0055114 oxidation-reduction process (count=1507)."
msgstr ""

